As per the reviewers’ comments, we make some revisions to the paper and mark them in blue. To summarize, the main revisions are as follows:

1. Simplified Notations in Section 3.1 and more discussion about Proposition 3.1;

2. We added more explanations for the motivation of disentanglement in Appendix A.3;

3. We added extra experimental results in Appendix A.4 to show the advantage of using disentanglement by comparing it with a new baseline GPRGNN.
